{"ID":"20240314091824-wzmqfnd","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091824-wzmqfnd","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091824-wzmqfnd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170956-zpvz060\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170956-awsp1ei\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170956-awsp1ei\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:33,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:33\u0026#125;","title":"【当归贝母苦参丸】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422170956"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422170956-zpvz060","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422170956-zpvz060","updated":"20240422170956"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"妊娠小便难，当归贝母苦参丸主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170956-xt0j402","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170956-xt0j402","updated":"20240422170956"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"当归贝母苦参丸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170956-mb6vcog","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170956-mb6vcog","updated":"20240422170956"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"当归贝母苦参丸方当归贝母苦参各四两"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170956-dh4iszo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170956-dh4iszo","updated":"20240422170956"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味末之，炼蜜丸，如小豆大，饮服三丸，加至十丸。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170956-ilya1p2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170956-ilya1p2","updated":"20240422170956"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"接下来呢，也是很常见的方。怀孕的时候，孕妇小便不好排，小便不利，是这个处方，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当归贝母苦参汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。当归、贝母、苦参呢各 4 两，你不用真的是 4 两哦，是等量的意思。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170956-f9627du","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170956-f9627du","updated":"20240422170956"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"可以把它打成粉末啊，然后一次吃一汤匙，一平匙的量。那如果还排不出来就加重就好了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。怀孕时候小便难，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"原因是因为胎儿压到膀胱，导致小便排不出来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那我们用当归、贝母、苦参..."},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"苦参专门呢能够利湿，利膀胱的湿啊"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"贝母能够利尿，还有贝母可以润肠"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，像当归一样可以润肠。那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当归本身呢，它除了有油脂润肠以外，当归本身可以补血"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以如果把泻热跟补血的药放在一起...小孩子为什么会压到膀胱？因为里面有热，热的话他就会转动，动的厉害就压到了。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170956-awsp1ei","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170956-awsp1ei","updated":"20240422170956"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个处方呢就是小便排不出来而已啊，你不要把它和后面的处方弄混了啊！"}]}]}